OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters spend third night at
OL,4,Ascene of Glasgow scrapyard blaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters have extinguished a major
OL,7,Fblaze at a scrapyard in Glasgow after
OL,8,Fbattling the flames for three nights.
OL,10,FThe Scottish Fire and Rescue Service
OL,11,F(SFRS) said the alarm was raised at the
OL,12,Fbusiness on South Street, in the
OL,13,FScotstoun area of the city, at about
OL,14,F23:23 on Friday.
OL,16,FNine fire engines, two high-reach
OL,17,Fvehicles and specialist resources
OL,18,Fresponded to the incident.
OL,20,FNo casualties were reported and the
OL,21,Ffire is not being treated as wilful.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
